-universe/brings-surface/maximal-ideal-defect.lean#L28-L51","doc":"**MaximalIdealDefect**: the maximal ideal 𝔪₁ at the unit coordinate\nz = 1 in the spectral fiber of the Frobenius–Hopf substrate.\n\nThis ideal is the kernel of the evaluation homomorphism ev₁ : A → k,\nand is distinguished as the fixed point of the antipode S.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:maximal-ideal-defect}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:maximal-ideal-defect","label":"def:maximal-ideal-defect","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/maximal-ideal-defect.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}